{"version":1,"key":"card:226","content":{"id":226,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d9b408df-6b97-4336-aae4-81cabbf36c0f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"生成器与迭代器的高级用法。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9793d7f6-cd6f-444d-8b7a-857c31121a27","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在调用迭代器的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"next"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法时，还可以向其中传入一个参数："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"25c046a1-e75b-49fd-a52a-b0bd98e4b161","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"04562dbd-ecdb-48f3-a587-054fe60cc597","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function* getIterator() {\n  let first = yield 1;\n  yield first + 2;\n}\n\nlet iterator = getIterator();\n\nconsole.log(iterator.next()); // { value: 1, done: false }\nconsole.log(iterator.next(2)); // { value: 4, done: false }","collabId":"d1a581cd-4d5e-4895-b423-8731c6ff7534","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29890094/106603651-8a528e80-6599-11eb-8361-5f83c0d00d0d.gif","previewUrl":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29890094/106603651-8a528e80-6599-11eb-8361-5f83c0d00d0d.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"4ed9cb22-e4db-43f9-8fd1-755e32cf8851","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c60ca4e5-0c96-4181-a58f-c54bd6b8d34d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的动图说明了代码的执行过程：当我们调用第一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"next"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，方法开始执行，当执行到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"yield 1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 后停止执行，挂起函数并将值返回，当我们第二次调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"next"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，这时我们传递一个参数，这个参数会被传递给 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"first"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，接着继续执行，当执行到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"yield first + 2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 挂起函数，并返回值。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"06b10e05-74c8-4fcf-80ec-a82984af7511","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"迭代器还有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"throw"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，它可以抛出一个错误"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"bce90c0b-b481-4b08-a725-061f145eb371","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c4253ec1-ca5c-4a7b-8015-94022cdee6ee","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function* getIterator() {\n  let first = yield 1;\n  try {\n    let second = yield first + 2;\n  } catch (e) {\n    second = 6;\n  }\n  yield second;\n}\n\nconst iterator = getIterator();\n\nconsole.log(iterator.next()); // { value: 1, done: false }\nconsole.log(iterator.next(2)); // { value: 4, done: false }\nconsole.log(iterator.throw(new Error(\"error...\"))); // { value: 6, done: false }\nconsole.log(iterator.next()); // { value: undefined, done: true }","collabId":"c3114b96-23fd-454a-b2c5-596a9a1566ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"66f7700f-355e-4588-a89b-e792b8117791","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有的时候希望能够组合多个迭代器，我们可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"yield*"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的语句来委托给别的生迭代器"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0892f23f-3902-42e6-9acb-717b3e8f6f54","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0342347c-2335-40b1-bcf1-377f031e4309","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function* generator01() {\n  yield 1;\n  yield 2;\n}\n\nfunction* generator02() {\n  yield 3;\n  yield 4;\n}\n\nfunction* generatorCombine() {\n  yield* generator01();\n  yield* generator02();\n}\n\nfor (value of generatorCombine()) {\n  console.log(value); // 1\n                      // 2\n                      // 3\n                      // 4\n}","collabId":"b1e34e57-6775-4953-ac61-946171b9cfd6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1690899447299,"updateTime":1753198583484,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1753198583484}}